# Champion's Victory: "Cast this spell only during the declare attackers step
# and only if you've been attacked this step" -- ActivationPhases$ Declare
# Attackers and CheckSVar$ X, X being
# PlayerCountPropertyYou$HasPropertyBeenAttackedThisCombat
# (SpellAbilityRestriction.java:294-298, :508-515; PlayerProperty.java:477-483).
# ai attacks human with Grizzly Bears, so human has been attacked this combat:
# the cast is allowed and the attacker returns to ai's hand.
# Untap -> Upkeep -> Draw -> Main1 -> BeginCombat -> Declare Attackers.
startturn ai
advance 5
queue attackers 3
declareattackers
tapformana human 2 U
queue targets 3
castspell human 1
resolvestack
